  "extract": "Guam (  GWAHM; Chamorro: Guåhan [ˈɡʷɑhɑn]) is an organized, unincorporated territory of the United States in the Micronesia subregion of Oceania, in the western Pacific Ocean. Guam's capital is Hagåtña, and the most populous village is Dededo.",
